# Locutus of Borg grants its trigger only to artifact creatures "you control" that deal combat damage "to a player"
# (CR 613.1f, 603.2, 510.2). Bot1's Memnite hits Bot2's Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer on turn 3 with Locutus out: damage to
# a planeswalker, no token. On turn 4 Bot2's Memnite hits Bot1: an opponent's creature, no token for either side. On
# turn 5 Bot1's Memnite hits Bot2: its own creature to a player, exactly one 1/1 Borg. Bot1 stays at 19, Ral keeps 2
# loyalty, and Bot2 falls to 19.

